rly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=This%20woman%20was%20in%20contract%20with%20a%20horror.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e11","summary":"Alena explains the cathar hid his wife's killings; he begs for her life and blames himself for the mausoleum.","participants":["alena","cathar-palter","mrs-palter","halana"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":105,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":132,"quote":"Three bodies, Mr. Palter. She killed three innocents.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Three%20bodies%2C%20Mr.%20Palter.%20She%20killed%20three%20innocents.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Three%20bodies%2C%20Mr.%20Palter.%20She%20killed%20three%20innocents.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e12","summary":"Mrs. Palter breaks free and stabs her husband in the chest, killing him.","participants":["mrs-palter","cathar-palter","halana","alena"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":105,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":137,"quote":"in one motion